DESCRIPTION:During the workshop we will create an HTTP-based API that inter
 acts as a chatbot.\n\nIt will cover key concepts and delines core challeng
 es such as:\n- including integrating a vector database for document retrie
 val\,\n- enhancing the capabilities of large language models with retrieve
 d context with *Langchain*\, \n- and finally exposing the core operations 
 through endpoints with *FastAPI* for seamless interaction. \n\nWhether you
 're a developer aiming to expand your AI toolkit or a data enthusiast expl
 oring RAG\, the aims to provide you with the knowledge and skills to desig
 n and deploy intelligent\, context-driven applications.
